                                                                  2831 1451
  Energy-angular distributions of discrete and continuum levels   2831 1451
  and photon transitions related to emitted charged particles     2831 1451
  (proton, deuteron, triton, helium-3 and alpha)                  2831 1451
  have been updated [1] using CoH3 [2] and formatted into         2831 1451
  the ENDF-6 format using DeCE [3]. The Q-values have been        2831 1451
  calculated using the mass data in Audi's 2012 mass table [4]    2831 1451
  and FRDM2012 massess [5].                                       2831 1451
